本AV女優清野咲（ig@saki.seino）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"21歲日本AV女優清野咲（ig@saki.seino）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260427/1125475696450736128469127.jpeg/v4AH6d8rF-xWgzRAI2Dz1ewBTRxMcJ4gqyAukasgLpE\"/><figcaption>21歲日本AV女優清野咲（ig@saki.seino）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260427/1125476310336933888831754.jpeg/j50D2xL8PkTISsu10DSMbl52o3bJaykeGIPnTBiD50w\"/><figcaption>21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260427/1125476313092722688497853.jpeg/fMsfbwrB6WVt5qYTsmHLY5XYN61dkyF_lZR5yJWUecg\"/><figcaption>21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260427/1125476318478471168241987.jpeg/lvKWgaCcW7ij4SJnOWQ0WE32epjk23Wb7S0o0u0tKNI\"/><figcaption>21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260427/1125476803121516544382506.jpeg/ss0JuIEI0ZxwwPa71AyTRlHFrfnQop9idi02-HYtNvg\"/><figcaption>21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260427/1125476805931831296719046.jpeg/nXsg_LMHYgl5IM75stScuE6V7J_QbYMoFFRuZBRUbmQ\"/><figcaption>21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260427/1125476808498876416408295.jpeg/E0V88LWkHU-gSbp2vTgZF8ls6Jiic0_O1HUTrtR1E64\"/><figcaption>21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260427/1125476881982820352347869.jpeg/8H8b8WvtiePGxjZ_USOMs38g1OMZiKN5y_FsLcvxbC0\"/><figcaption>21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260427/1125476884721831936765410.jpeg/LTs3lrqDVusEg7a72W0tXJSUGUUj0ffRw4UZqcOFGak\"/><figcaption>21歲日本AV女優清野咲（X@saki_seino）</figcaption></figure><p>這條評論底下有人回了一句，點出了真正的分歧：問題不在於「做過什麼」，在於「她是以什麼身份被看的」。星乃莉亞被推到台前的時候，身上貼的標籤是「偶像級美貌」、「羅蘭節目走出來的灰姑娘」。那個標籤越乾淨，過去的影子就越刺眼。</p><p>至於星乃莉亞自己，她在影片最後說，會回到六本木繼續上班：「不會逃避過去，會用更認真的態度面對每一位客人。」</p><p>她說了一句讓很多人破防的話。她說做那份工作的時候，「心が死ぬというか、きつくて」——心好像在死去，很煎熬。一個24歲的人，為了父親的住院費和妹妹的高中，選了一個讓自己「心死」的選項，只做了很短一段時間，然後花了兩年爬起來，站到了六本木最亮的燈光下面。</p><p>然後有人把那段「心死」的日子翻出來，一幀一幀地攤在所有人面前。</p><p>【本文獲「日本這些事兒」授權轉載，微信公眾號：riben66666666】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T11:21:01.027201+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":3351,"images":40,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T11:00:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T13:25:50.723874+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T11:18:22.853566+00:00","content_hash":"f57e7fc85a6a9d019c634587a6bddd48db24126666b3d7b018d12e9dd6491a6d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}